      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "@tangleai/core",
          "type": "patch"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Build on Jaren 0.246.0. Plan diagrams quote an edge label that holds brackets, as Mermaid 11 reads it; a schedule's skipped runs are counted exactly after downtime for plain rules; a SQLite write waits for another connection's write lock instead of failing at once; and object and tuple schemas validate faster. No store table changes: a store this release writes still opens under the previous release.",
      "id": "jaren-0-246"
    },
    {
      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "@tangleai/os",
          "type": "minor"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Jobs takes `configure: null` for a host where nothing can be set up: a part without a job queue then says that no background work runs there and why there is nothing to set up, and offers no way to Settings. Without the option, Jobs still offers Settings, as before.\n\nDesktop text keys since v0.74.0:\n\n- Added (2): `jobs/none`, `jobs/none-detail`",
      "id": "jobs-nothing-to-set-up"
    }
  ],
